orthant 1 language

- The `cellulose` module, which implemented CoDL and its binary form BCoDL, has been
- removed. Its role is filled by [TEL](/doc/soundness/modules/tel.md), whose binary encoding is BinTEL.
+ Se ha eliminado el módulo `cellulose`, que implementaba CoDL y su forma binaria BCoDL. Su papel
+ lo cumple [TEL](/doc/soundness/modules/tel.md), cuya codificación binaria es BinTEL.
